          "caption": "Variations of Taiwanese tapioca pearls (珍珠) at the Raohe Street Night Market (饒河街觀光夜市) in Taipei, Taiwan. From left to right, the labels indicate: 原味 (original flavor); 焦糖红豆 (caramel azuki bean); 巧克力 (chocolate); 抹茶红豆 (matcha azuki bean); and 芝麻 (sesame). These \"pearls\" are to be mixed in \"bubble (boba) milk tea\" (珍珠奶茶 or 波霸奶茶) or another drink of your choice.",
